B.Nn=new A.bM("Lahayis is a strange place. Instead of humans, humanoid cats call this continent their home. A part of this world is always covered in a mysterious mist that can\u2019t be traversed through until all of a sudden the mist disappears and the land beyond the mist can be explored.\n\nIn this land there lives a strange tribe of cat \u2013 werewolf cats. Their land is called Lycana and it is dark and shadowy. The Lykoi are able to use dark magic and are very reliant on the nature of the \u201cshadowy lands\u201d - especially when searching for light sources. Because of the giant trees and ever present fog this strange cat tribe has to rely on fluorescence as their main light source.\n\nAll the cat tribes of the other lands of Lahayis decide to send ambassadors to this strange land to familiarize with the new culture \u2013 this team of ambassadors face challenges as they begin to see themselves as the aliens but also start to fall in love with this strange land \u2013 they have to interact with the lykoi cats to form an intercultural bond and to begin to see themselves as part of a big whole.\n\nAgainst all odds the different ambassadors decide \u2013 each on their own \u2013 to help the politically corrupt and economically struggling land of Lycana to extend their sought after light sources \u2013 in form of the highly valuable radiant crystals.",null,B.Mh,null,null)
